  "content": "[Intro]\n[Abm]\n[F#]\n[F]\n[D#m]\n[Abm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Abm]Crying out.\nNow\nyou can't escape you are\nburied in doubt And it\npulls you down\nNow\nyou’re in too deep you may\nnever get out Such an\naw-\nful\nplace\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Abm]Tear it down\nIt’s\nalmost too late is the\nend coming now As you\nscream out loud\nYou\nsever the peace ’til your\ntruth has been found\n\n[Interlude]\n[Abm]Is there noth-\ning left to fol-\n[E]low?\n[Abm]Is there noth-\ning left to steal?\n[E]\n[Abm]Crying out\nfor something more\n[E]than I’ve been sho-\nwn Knowing none\n[Abm]of\nthis is\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[A]real\n[B]\n[Dbdim]\n[Edim]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Ab5]Don’t\nclose your\n[B5]eyes\nSomething beau-\n[F#5]tiful\nis still alive\n[Db/F]\n[Ab5]Don’t\nclose your\n[B5]eyes\nNever turn\n[F#5]away\nand let it die\n[Db/F]\n\n[Break]\n[Ab5]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Abm]I cannot seem\nto find the an-\n[E]swers\n[Abm]Every truth\nhas slipped away\n[E]\n[Abm]All that ridd-\nles me will ne-\n[E]ver cease to be\nStill I search\n[Abm]this\nworld in\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[A]vain\n[B]\n[Dbdim]\n[Edim]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Ab5]Don’t\nclose your\n[B5]eyes\nSomething beau-\n[F#5]tiful\nis still alive\n[Db/F]\n[Ab5]Don’t\nclose your\n[B5]eyes\nNever turn\n[F#5]away\nand let it die\n[Db/F]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Eb5]\nCry\nout to\nsave to-\nmorrow\nIt’s\nnot too\nlate\nOr your\nheavy\nheart will\nfollow\nYou\nto the\ngrave\n\n[Bridge]\n[Eb5]This is not\nthe end\nThis is not\nthe end\n\n[Solo]\n[Abm]\n[E]\n[Abm]\n[Eb]\n[Abm]\n[Eb]\n[Abm]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Gdim]\n[Bbdim]\n[Dbdim]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Ab5]Don’t\nclose your\n[B5]eyes\nSomething beau-\n[F#5]tiful\nis still alive\n[Db/F]\n[Ab5]Don’t\nclose your\n[B5]eyes\nNever turn\n[F#5]away\nand let it die\n[Db/F]\n\n[Solo]\n[Ab5]\n[B5]\n[F#5]\n[Db/F]\n[Ab5]\n[B5]\n[F#5]\n[Db/F]\n\n[Outro]\n[Abm]We can’t hesitate,\nhope is not too late\nFor the time has come,\nwhat have we become?\nNothing left to do\n[Gb5]but deny the truth\n[E5]\n[Eb5]\n[Ab5]",
